   "text": "33. Rahu is blue colored. He has a huge body. He is of a low caste. He has ",
   "bbox": [
    121,
    299,
    556,
    314
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "got skin disease. He is irreligious. He suffers from hic-cough.",
   "bbox": [
    85,
    323,
    429,
    339
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "He speaks falsehood. He is cunning, a leper devoid of Intelligence and ",
   "bbox": [
    121,
    347,
    556,
    363
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "defames others.",
   "bbox": [
    85,
    371,
    173,
    387
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "34. The eyes of Ketu are reddish with a fierce look. He has a venomous ",
   "bbox": [
    121,
    395,
    556,
    411
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "tongue. His body is elevated. He wears arms and is an outcaste. His body is of ",
   "bbox": [
    85,
    420,
    556,
    435
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "smoky color. He is always inhaling smoke (smoking). He has a body marked with ",
   "bbox": [
    85,
    444,
    556,
    459
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "bruises. He is lean and brutal by nature.",
   "bbox": [
    85,
    468,
    307,
    483
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "35. The substance assigned to Rahu is lead and his clothes are old and worn ",
   "bbox": [
    121,
    492,
    556,
    508
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "out. An earthen pot and garments of variegated colors belong to Ketu.",
   "bbox": [
    85,
    516,
    476,
    532
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "Mercury, Saturn and Venus are the friends of Rahu and Ketu. Mars is neutral ",
   "bbox": [
    121,
    540,
    556,
    556
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "to them. The rest are enemies.",
   "bbox": [
    85,
    565,
    253,
    580
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "36. The planets should be considered adversely disposed, if they are eclipsed ",
   "bbox": [
    121,
    589,
    556,
    604
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "(by the rays of the Sun), debilitated (be in a sign of debilitation or Navamsa), if ",
   "bbox": [
    85,
    613,
    556,
    628
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "they are in any enemy's house or if they occupy the 6th, 8th or the 12th house from ",
   "bbox": [
    85,
    637,
    556,
    652
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "the Ascendant. If they occupy other places, they are said to be well disposed.",
   "bbox": [
    85,
    661,
    515,
    677
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "If there be a query whether the water in a reservoir (or in an irrigation ",
   "bbox": [
    121,
    685,
    556,
    701
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "project) will increase or decrease, increase in water should be predicted if the ",
   "bbox": [
    85,
    709,
    556,
    725
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "Moon be in the 12th 11th, 1st, 6th. 5th or the 7th house at the time of the query.",
   "bbox": [
    85,
    734,
    529,
    749
   ]
  },
  {
